[en.FOCUS_C12_OVERCOME_HARDSHIPS]
Overcome hardships together

[en.FOCUS_C12_OVERCOME_HARDSHIPS_desc]
The Pie family and the Apple family have weathered many storms together, proving their loyalty to each other. Both sides will continue to increase their investments in each other, working towards greater economic integration.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_OVERCOME_HARDSHIPS]
共渡难关

[zh.FOCUS_C12_OVERCOME_HARDSHIPS_desc]
派家族与苹果家族已经共同经历了风风雨雨，也证明了彼此的忠诚。双方将继续加大对对方的投资力度，为实现经济一体化而努力。

